    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>riddling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμῳ σχεδικῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					241.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ς. τόλμα</span> the daring
				<i>of riddle-composers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				714.51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τὰ ς. λαλοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1634.16
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>, perh. to be restd. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδιακῶς</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1545.7
			</span></i>.</div>
